# Authored on Windows, consumed by a Linux runner. LayoutTests compare the runner's LF output
# against -expected.txt byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout would fail every test for a reason that
# has nothing to do with the finding. Force LF on everything.
* text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
